#: src/Connectors/Providers/ClientToolFilterGuidance.php:46
msgid ""
"Start with the read-only audit set. Client-side filtering can reduce model "
"context and accidental tool selection, but it is not an authorization "
"boundary and does not grant or revoke WordPress authorization."
msgstr ""

